移除不需要的依赖（孤儿包）
sudo pacman -Rsn $(pacman -Qtdq)

清除包缓存
paccache -rk0

列出指定安装的包（官方仓库）
pacman -Qenq

列出指定安装的包（AUR）
pacman -Qemq

搜索包
pacman -Ss	远程仓库
pacman -Qs	本地仓库

显示包信息
pacman -Si	远程仓库
pacman -Qi	本地仓库

### SSD TRIM
"discard, nodiscard(*)
Controls whether ext4 should issue discard/TRIM commands to the underlying block device when blocks are freed. This is useful for SSD devices and sparse/thinly-provisioned LUNs, but it is off by default until sufficient testing has been done."
from "https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/ext4.html#options"

启用周期性 fstrim 
systemctl enable --now fstrim.timer

